  "description": "<p>A lightweight client-side plugin for Single Player Tarkov that provides the player with infinite stamina.</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Infinite Sprint: Leg stamina remains at 100%.</li>\n<li>Player-Only: The logic specifically targets the local player, meaning AI Scavs and PMCs will still tire and breathe heavily as usual.</li>\n<li>Live Toggle: Enable or disable the mod instantly during a raid using the BepInEx Configuration Menu (F12).</li>\n</ul>\n",
